    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s14-t02-practice-01-question",
      "type": "question",
      "title": "思维精练 · 第1题",
      "question": {
        "id": "quantity-wy27-s14-t02-practice-01",
        "type": "single",
        "stem": "（25国考）甲船在A港正东n海里，乙船在A港正南√3n海里，两船相距120海里，同时出发向A港匀速行驶。已知乙船的速度是甲船的2√3倍，比甲船早3小时到A港。问甲船的速度是多少海里/小时？",
        "options": [
          {
            "value": "A",
            "label": "10"
          },
          {
            "value": "B",
            "label": "15"
          },
          {
            "value": "C",
            "label": "103"
          },
          {
            "value": "D",
            "label": "153"
          }
        ],
        "answer": "A",
        "sourceAnswer": "A"
      },
      "source": {
        "type": "pdf",
        "documentId": "quantity-wy27",
        "title": "王炎·27数量关系大满贯·讲义",
        "pages": [
