    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s14-t02-practice-03-question",
      "type": "question",
      "title": "思维精练 · 第3题",
      "question": {
        "id": "quantity-wy27-s14-t02-practice-03",
        "type": "single",
        "stem": "（26联考）一条输电线沿着A地的东北方向布设，B地、C地均在A地正东方向，距离A地分别为4公里、6公里，D地在C地正北方向2公里处。现从输电线的某处P点分别搭建两条电缆至B、D两地，则这两条电缆长度之和最小为多少公里？",
        "options": [
          {
            "value": "A",
            "label": "4√2"
          },
          {
            "value": "B",
            "label": "4√3"
          },
          {
            "value": "C",
            "label": "3√6"
          },
          {
            "value": "D",
            "label": "2√10"
          }
        ],
        "answer": "D",
        "sourceAnswer": "D"
      },
      "source": {
        "type": "pdf",
        "documentId": "quantity-wy27",
        "title": "王炎·27数量关系大满贯·讲义",
        "pages": [
          148
        ],
        "printedPages": [
          142
        ],
        "originalImages": [
          {
            "src": "assets/images/courses/quantity-wy27/quantity-wy27-s14-t02-practice-03-p148.webp",
            "alt": "几何问题（一） · 思维精练3 · 讲义第142页",
            "pdfPage": 148
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s14-t02-practice-03-explanation-01",
      "type": "text",
      "role": "explanation",
      "title": "我们这样分析",
      "questionId": "quantity-wy27-s14-t02-practice-03",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "讲义参考答案：D"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "我们以A为原点，正东为x轴、正北为y轴。输电线是y=x的东北射线，B为（4，0），D为（6，2）。"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "把B关于y=x对称到B′（0，4）。P在线上时PB=PB′，因此PB+PD最小就是直线B′D的长度。B′D与y=x相交于（3，3），确实在东北射线上。"
        },
        {
          "type": "formula",
          "latex": "PB+PD\\ge B\\!\\prime D=\\sqrt{(6-0)^2+(2-4)^2}=2\\sqrt{10}"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "最短距离√（6²+2²）=2√10公里，我们选D。最后检查交点落在允许的射线内，反射法才真正可取到。"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "这道题记住什么"
        }
      ],
